Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 01:26:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] remix api: retained scene instances, Submit,
 UpdateMaterial

SceneInstanceAdd/Update/Remove keep converted ExternalDrawState on the CS
thread, keyed by caller-side handles (never 0, never reused). Submit
replays live instances through the existing DrawInstance path once per
frame; Present does the replay if the frame had no Submit. Update and
Remove on unknown handles return INVALID_ARGUMENTS. UpdateMaterial
replaces the material data by handle. Retained state is cleared at
Shutdown. Linux-only debug export remixlinux_GetRetainedSceneStats.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tb41TgDi74v7sgH5LJBZ5A
